    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "name": "书名.txt",
      "size": 1024000,
      "addedAt": "2024-01-01",
      "lastReadPosition": 1234,
      "lastReadTime": "2024-01-02"
    }
  ]
}
```

### 存储限制与应对
